alk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7213201,"initDialog":721320101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[20248],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":72132,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":721320101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":2374056114,"text":"Thanks for your efforts. Although the island is still full of dangers, this will give a little hope to all the people who have left their hometown and long to return.","nextNodeIds":[721320102]},{"nodeId":721320102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":3329635154,"text":"The fact that the rain has stopped may actually make the warring parties more aggressive in fighting for the island...","nextNodeIds":[721320103]},{"nodeId":721320103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":2581162010,"text":"But they were never going to help resolve the situation on the island anyway. What we have done is at least better than leaving the problem to fester.","nextNodeIds":[721320104]},{"nodeId":721320104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":2599102138,"text":"Now, the gift I promised you.","nextNodeIds":[721320105]},{"nodeId":721320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":2037584386,"text":"This is the famed spear once used by the Prefects of Yashiori. Now, I'm not sure how much use this drawing will be to you...","nextNodeIds":[721320107]},{"nodeId":721320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":640924258,"text":"But if you give it to a sufficiently skilled smith, they should be able to recreate the glory it once had in Lord Kitain's hands.","nextNodeIds":[721320108]},{"nodeId":721320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":1656872458,"text":"*sigh* Alas, the age of heroes has come and gone, and the Kitain, who once destroyed so many evils, will never return again.","nextNodeIds":[721320109]},{"nodeId":721320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":2745080162,"text":"Still, we seem to have gotten a step closer to matching Lord Kitain's deeds in the present, thanks to your help.","nextNodeIds":[721320110]},{"nodeId":721320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","textMapHash":671077538,"text":"Next, I will go to my friends in the Shogunate army to see if there's anything I can help with. I hope to see you again in the future.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7213201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3080","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_WEATHER_GADGET"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3088","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_WEATHER_GADGET"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3087","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_WEATHER_GADGET"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3089","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_WEATHER_GADGET"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["20248"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7213201,7213202],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20248,"speakerName":"Kaji","count":9},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20259,"speakerName":"Place","count":1},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":1}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172132],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3704291174,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAIN